ia</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Two Pesos</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1882</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rarity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Scarce</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick no.&deg; 6</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged Banknote of Two Pesos\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-republica-bolivar-2-pesos-1882\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\"></span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-republica-bolivar-2-pesos-1882.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-republica-bolivar-2-pesos-1882.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Two Pesos de la Bolivar Republic of Colombia, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The first years of the Republic:</strong>These banknotes were issued in 1882, in the years after the dissolution of Gran Colombia, when the country was still seeking to consolidate a unified national monetary system. They represent one of the first attempts at republican paper money in circulation in Colombia, before the centralization that the National Bank would later bring.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Fractional values for everyday commerce:</strong>The low denominations of One Peso and Two Pesos, issued as part of the same series, responded to the chronic shortage of fractional metallic currency and facilitated daily transactions of the time.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Testimony to state-building:</strong>These banknotes are direct testimonies of the process of institutional and monetary construction of the young Republic of Colombia during the 19th century.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on Banknotes</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>shield of the Republic in the center with the flag and allegorical elements, headed by &ldquo;Bolivar Republic of Colombia&rdquo; and the payment formula &ldquo;Upon presentation the Amount of&hellip;&rdquo;, with the denomination repeated in the corners and side bands.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>repeats the obverse design in reverse (mirrored) transparency, a printing technique typical of 19th-century paper money intended to deter counterfeiting.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Handwritten signatures and numbering:</strong>Both bills retain space for handwritten signatures and individual numbering, practices typical of banking and government issuance of the time.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">Pick, Albert.<em>Standard Catalog of World Paper Money — Specialized Issues</em>; Hernández, Pedro Pablo.<em>Coins and Banknotes of Colombia</em>; Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
